{
  "description": "Japanese sign-up in a table (お名前 / メールアドレス / パスワード / パスワード（確認用）), generic ids, no autocomplete, email is type=text",
  "fields": {
    "#f0": "name",
    "#f1": "email",
    "#f2": "new-password",
    "#f3": "confirm-password"
